<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11928" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπερί-ληπτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>uncircumscribed,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξουσία ἀ.</span>
			<i>absolute</i> power, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				25
			</span></i>; <i>indeterminate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theol.Ar.
				58
			</span></i>; <i>not to be embraced</i> or <i>comprehended,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστήμῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>VP</u>
					29.159
				</span></i>
			: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ ἀ. τῆς δυνάμεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.9.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				150
			</span></i>; <i>incomprehensible,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				1.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. κατὰ τὸν ἀριθμὸν κόσμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					8.159
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				5.14
			</span></i>; <i>indefinite</i> (opp. <i>infinite</i>) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐχ ἁπλῶς ἄπειροι ἀλλὰ μόνον ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					1p.8U.
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				1.3.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				9
			</span></i>.</div>
